    "enUS": {
      "description": "Time for a special delivery.\r\n\r\nOld Krom'rosh is waiting for this package over at Rog'mar just west of here.\r\n\r\nI suggest you get it to him quickly, but carefully. Why, you might ask? It's better to not ask questions.",
      "summary": "Deliver Frazzlespark's Crate to Krom'rosh at Rog'mar.",
